    "title": "Blood Pressure Tracker",
    "description": "<b>Blood Pressure Tracker</b> helps you to log your blood pressure, monitor blood pressure trends and shared with your family and doctor.\r\n\r\nThe app does NOT measure blood pressure.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features</b>\r\n\u2605 Log your systolic, diastolic, pulse, glucose, oxygen and weight\r\n\u2605 Navigate in calendar view\r\n\u2605 Share your blood pressure with your doctors\r\n\u2605 Report in csv, html, Excel and pdf\r\n\u2605 Organize your blood pressure by tags\r\n\u2605 Automatically calculate blood pressure categories\r\n\u2605 Summary your blood pressure in max, min and avg\r\n\u2605 Monitor blood pressure trends\r\n\u2605 Helpful to monitor and control your blood pressure\r\n\r\n<b>Have an idea or feature suggestion</b>\r\nhttps://support.androidappshk.com/blood-pressure/\r\n\r\n[Upgrade to pay version]\r\n1. buy and install pay version\r\n2. backup database of lite version by backup function\r\n3. install database of pay version by restore function\r\n\r\n\u203b If you like the app, then please give us a good rating as the driving force behind our continued development, thank you.\r\n\u203b Since we can't reply reviews in the market, if you have any suggestions or questions please mail to our mailbox directly. For market reviews, please just leave your rating and cheers, thanks again.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Blood Pressure Tracker</b> helps you to log your blood pressure, monitor blood pressure trends and shared with your family and doctor.<br><br>The app does NOT measure blood pressure.<br><br><b>Key Features</b><br>\u2605 Log your systolic, diastolic, pulse, glucose, oxygen and weight<br>\u2605 Navigate in calendar view<br>\u2605 Share your blood pressure with your doctors<br>\u2605 Report in csv, html, Excel and pdf<br>\u2605 Organize your blood pressure by tags<br>\u2605 Automatically calculate blood pressure categories<br>\u2605 Summary your blood pressure in max, min and avg<br>\u2605 Monitor blood pressure trends<br>\u2605 Helpful to monitor and control your blood pressure<br><br><b>Have an idea or feature suggestion</b><br>https://support.androidappshk.com/blood-pressure/<br><br>[Upgrade to pay version]<br>1. buy and install pay version<br>2. backup database of lite version by backup function<br>3. install database of pay version by restore function<br><br>\u203b If you like the app, then please give us a good rating as the driving force behind our continued development, thank you.<br>\u203b Since we can&#39;t reply reviews in the market, if you have any suggestions or questions please mail to our mailbox directly. For market reviews, please just leave your rating and cheers, thanks again.",
